[{"title":"乌桓对酒","author":"刘璟","text":"对酒乌桓国，多愁白发翁。\n家乡六千里，生计一丝风。\n净几閒清简，空囊老漆弓。\n幸逢烽火息，何必事奇功。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":38166,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"环清轩","author":"刘璟","text":"绕屋流清水，非沽洗耳名。\n琴书怡雅志，风月足閒情。\n澄碧鱼堪数，繁阴鸟自鸣。\n馀生欣有托，宠辱莫相惊。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":38167,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"应诏谨赓御制赐晋齐诸将宴鹤鸣楼","author":"刘璟","text":"扈从归来宴玉楼，九天雨露沛高秋。\n勋藏盟府蒙新宠，酒入忠肝洗旧愁。\n沙漠已平神略伟，乾坤再造圣功优。\n一时际会攀鳞翼，岂意微劳幸见收。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":38168,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"咏鹦鹉和张纪善韵","author":"刘璟","text":"西域珍禽解语声，高飞时展拂云翎。\n孝慈为禀淳和性，辩惠非求世俗听。\n舞罢毳衣栖琐殿，啄馀香稻立雕衡。\n上林鹰犬多如簇，独得君王御眼青。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":38169,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"山行同张纪善","author":"刘璟","text":"度谷穿崖亿万重，龙门东下一川通。\n路逢驿使无梅信，地走山翁有雪踪。\n李老祠荒蒿没像，单于台古草连空。\n行人日暮向何处，戎马萧萧鸣北风。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":38170,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"雕窝山","author":"刘璟","text":"万叠苍山朔气浓，雪花开遍玉芙蓉。\n皂雕飞处青云近，骢马行时紫塞重。\n家在江南书万里，身居冀北禄千钟。\n生来自愧承恩厚，华发萧萧未策功。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":38171,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"隆庆州北平山神会寺废趾","author":"刘璟","text":"昔年宝刹倚云根，半壁孤高露粉痕。\n叠巘插天苍隼立，群峰拔地白狼蹲。\n苔碑有字湮名姓，钟梵无声报晓昏。\n山下屯军新聚落，依稀烟火旧时村。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":38172,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"鸡鸣山用前韵","author":"刘璟","text":"鸡鸣古寺立岩嶅，败壁颓垣没野蒿。\n二水交流冰镜合，一峰独立石屏高。\n常疑尘雾如飞雪，又怪山风似怒涛。\n旧日但闻沙塞地，谁知身向此中遨。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":38173,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"娄氏萝石轩","author":"刘璟","text":"搆得轩居一径幽，青萝白石倚高秋。\n松床月转琴声远，丝蔓风回树影稠。\n屈子有时纫佩带，孙郎曾此漱琳球。\n时清不献和亲计，诗酒从容兴最优。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":38174,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"萧太后红城","author":"刘璟","text":"榆林塞下旧红城，四面寒泉彻底清。\n行殿昔留耶律驾，断桥曾驻乞颜旌。\n蛟龙戏水当年事，赑屃埋蒿此日情。\n立马林皋一回首，群鸦飞处夕阳明。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":38175,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"野斋","author":"刘璟","text":"幽居萧散绝喧哗，恰似柴桑处士家。\n门径莓苔无俗客，池塘鼓吹有鸣蛙。\n冬青万树凝新蜡，春菜几畦开杂花。\n但得眼前风物好，尽将诗酒作生涯。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":38176,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"清溪观寄王嵩涧道士","author":"刘璟","text":"斋居每忆清溪观，乱石巉岩漱碧流。\n双井泉通三岛脉，万松声度九天秋。\n点易道人骖白鹤，吹箫仙子驾青虬。\n披云我欲寻真诀，愿借当年莲叶舟。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":38177,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"游赵川清安寺","author":"刘璟","text":"当年龙战混玄黄，多少亭台变鹿场。\n蔓草翳阶空古迹，松肪落地老寒香。\n百年事业成凋换，千古神灵竟渺茫。\n此日登临重感慨，又逢葭琯复初阳。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":38178,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"矾山道中过桑园渡","author":"刘璟","text":"矾山东下桑园渡，春水初生日正融。\n雁影飞穿杨柳外，马声嘶过杏花中。\n谁云塞北风沙异，却与江南景物同。\n最喜皇恩加四远，且将耕牧训边农。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":38179,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"龙虎台","author":"刘璟","text":"龙虎台前朔鸟飞，沙场倦客正南驰。\n閒云缥缈暮天远，落日苍茫叠嶂迷。\n草木尽沾新雨露，人民复睹汉官仪。\n庙堂已得安边策，老我登临好咏诗。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":38180,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"暮宿德州壮屯","author":"刘璟","text":"斜晖驱马憩孤亭，酾酒呼童慰客情。\n黄叶委堤秋水落，白蒿连野暮云平。\n颓垣破瓦前人宅，吠犬鸣鸡戍卒营。\n五十年来萧索尽，如今正好望时清。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":38181,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赠沈思善","author":"刘璟","text":"沈生壮游今几年，复回故山看画船。\n西湖新水碧于酒，岳坟古树青含烟。\n陶情经史三千卷，得意诗词数百篇。\n眼底风光真可乐，尽将穷达付苍天。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":38182,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"十五里荡","author":"刘璟","text":"一叶轻舟落照中，开篷纵目竟长空。\n连塍禾黍横云绿，夹岸荷花照水红。\n新雁带秋来远浦，老龙拖雨过前峰。\n当时真意知心寡，长笛一声生晚风。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":38183,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"晓发郑梁河闸出江得顺风纪行","author":"刘璟","text":"西山挂月潮水生，风顺扁舟溯浪轻。\n黄家洋上过天阙，焦山口北望中?。\n地涌岩㠂镇溟渤，天生形势壮神京。\n晚凉泊掉龙潭渚，更喜沧江似掌平。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":38184,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"东山草堂","author":"刘璟","text":"草堂不与浣花同，移上东山出鲁峰。\n招隐短章吟白雪，读书长日对青松。\n莫言世上无鸣凤，却忆隆中有卧龙。\n可是苍生望安石，未应丘壑独从容。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":38185,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"子陵台","author":"刘璟","text":"不有飞龙白水乡，先生何处得徜徉。\n当时政事归台阁，千古丝纶占富阳。\n士节不随今世屈，客星聊为故人忙。\n扁舟吊古荒台下，流水閒云正渺茫。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":38186,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"次桂先生韵且酬之","author":"刘璟","text":"承恩重喜到京华，无复边城满帽沙。\n凤阙退朝怀旧友，麟经开卷想名家。\n屋梁午夜看明月，秋水长天赋落霞。\n白雁衔来新制作，光辉璀璨上林花。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":38187,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"孤鹤 其一","author":"刘璟","text":"一声清唳九天闻，羽族丛中少似君。\n赤壁夜来惊醉客，缑山朝下伴閒云。\n高飞懒逐乘轩侣，遐引慵随啄腐群。\n只影蹁跹天宇阔，俯观人世正纷纷。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":38188,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"孤鹤 其二","author":"刘璟","text":"卓荦高情世共闻，还丹独就有仙君。\n归来辽海栖华表，飞过箫台拂綵云。\n远俗只宜寻凤友，可人应自出鸡群。\n有时刷羽高松顶，不把空拳解世纷。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":38189,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"甘露寺多景楼","author":"刘璟","text":"南连吴会北维扬，俯瞰江流万里长。\n甘露旧从天上落，庆云时傍日边翔。\n莺啼淑景园花媚，龙蛰清秋海气凉。\n前代英雄筹策处，至今人事几兴亡。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":38190,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"焦山寺","author":"刘璟","text":"焦公炼丹丹已成，飞剑直斩石公精。\n名山便作佛世界，庙食犹显神英灵。\n浮玉峰前苍隼集，吸江亭下碧涛平。\n花开花谢谁为主，潮去潮来似有情。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":38191,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"石门洞","author":"刘璟","text":"洞天山水最清奇，架壑连岩结构危。\n石径云深荒蔓草，野林霜晓熟棠梨。\n入山却下听猿泪，看瀑长吟谢客诗。\n夜宿群峰最高处，俯看星宿列珠玑。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":38192,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"梅花 其一","author":"刘璟","text":"不随桃李弄精神，独抱孤高意更真。\n玉骨冰肌姑射子，锦心绣口谪仙人。\n平安岁月宜交友，恬澹风光度劫尘。\n昨夜南枝初爆蕊，雪中争道见阳春。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":38193,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"梅花 其二","author":"刘璟","text":"子建当年赋洛神，一时邂逅未为真。\n若知江上芳心客，岂慕岩阿艳质人。\n月冷香魂常入幕，天寒罗袜不生尘。\n建安风骨多豪俊，可惜无诗咏此春。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":38194,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"梅花 其三","author":"刘璟","text":"试问江干老树神，寒花何事独纯真。\n诗仙去后无宾侣，禅友归来有主人。\n道向雪霜修白业，曾于劫火脱红尘。\n月中世界如银色，谁解清香带得春。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":38195,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"梅花 其四","author":"刘璟","text":"夜泊长洲见水神，不修娇媚任天真。\n香飘老树风惊鹤，影入清江月近人。\n诗思若泉无杂虑，虚明如练绝纤尘。\n罗浮可到沧溟阔，料想应同此地春。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":38196,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"梅花 其五","author":"刘璟","text":"玉蕊含章妙入神，雪中谁得似渠真。\n担头归计功成将，墙角生涯遁世人。\n青子作酸调鼎实，素娥凝笑却妆尘。\n罗浮风景都休话，最爱三冬一味春。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":38197,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"梅花 其六","author":"刘璟","text":"潇湘江上雪中神，劲节寒花趣最真。\n守志汉宫辞辇客，报恩湘水泣珠人。\n瑶琴调转关山月，羌笛声催车马尘。\n清境皎然无滓翳，谁能识破此时春。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":38198,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"梅花 其七","author":"刘璟","text":"江上梅花玉雪神，移栽山舍伴清真。\n不惟劲节陪残岁，更有新香送故人。\n玉堂学士才如海，天目高僧妙脱尘。\n试折一枝相问讯，百篇高兴不胜春。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":38199,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"梅花 其八","author":"刘璟","text":"一声玉笛暗伤神，忽忆家山思倍真。\n塞北绝无同调客，江南多有赏音人。\n碧窗含影来寒月，绣阁浮香和暖尘。\n今日重游歌舞地，剩簪芳蕊为迎春。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":38200,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"梅花 其九","author":"刘璟","text":"干如精铁老犹神，独秀江干胜玉真。\n香绽寒枝惊木客，珠生枯蘖骇鲛人。\n霜威未遂金笳调，阳气初吹玉管尘。\n残腊尚留芳意在，剩簪银烛照和春。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":38201,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"梅花 其十","author":"刘璟","text":"靓妆高髻不为神，绰约仙姿自在真。\n岁晚长江无凤侣，天寒空谷有佳人。\n清香度水月笼影，□萼委堤风送尘。\n新叶渐抽青实小，人间正是艳阳春。","collection":"明","notice":"含缺文或待核对标记，按原文保留。","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":38202,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"鸡鸣山用前韵","author":"刘璟","text":"鸡鸣山势壮边州，钟梵荒台在上头。\n独石下藏千佛洞，群峰中见两河流。\n路有碑阴题汉字，桥无阁道度梁辀。\n登临不用增惆怅，古往今来总一沤。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":38203,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"三归台","author":"刘璟","text":"一自西郊叹黍离，下堂交质事尤非。\n射钩既释当时忿，定霸应为万世师。\n海宇未驯周典则，江黄又见楚旌旗。\n可怜匡世经纶手，宁是偷安脉祸机。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":38204,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"水仙花","author":"刘璟","text":"婀娜仙姿江汉阿，宛疑月殿下嫦娥。\n翠翘弄影天风细，玉质浮香雨露多。\n交甫褰裳承委佩，思王按辔赋凌波。\n岁寒无愧盟三友，击节抒情为尔歌。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":38205,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"芦雁 其一","author":"刘璟","text":"鸿雁飞时塞草秋，风沙飒飒使人愁。\n因君为报江南信，苏武天山雪满头。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":38206,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"芦雁 其二","author":"刘璟","text":"天目山前粳稻秋，西风归雁影悠悠。\n月明何处云罗远，浩荡湖波水满洲。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":38207,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"小景扇面","author":"刘璟","text":"翠老双松枫叶红，钓丝摇曳半江风。\n云山万叠归程稳，莫使羊裘入画中。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":38208,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"画葡萄 其一","author":"刘璟","text":"忽疑前夜风雨急，苍苍乱木蟠虬龙。\n枯藤老骨化不去，络索倒垂烟露空。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":38209,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"画葡萄 其二","author":"刘璟","text":"葡萄子熟边草秋，葡萄酒熟雪成毬。\n将军烂醉?毹月，士卒惊寒入敝裘。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":38210,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题竹 其一","author":"刘璟","text":"谁将天上琅玕树，栽向连湾绿水湄。\n岁晚江空鸾凤远，白云幽石自相宜。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":38211,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题竹 其二","author":"刘璟","text":"潇洒含风玉数茎，若何偏向石间生。\n贞心谅有夷齐识，耐惯冰霜老更青。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":38212,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"幽石 其一","author":"刘璟","text":"桃花间竹柳垂阴，独坐茅亭啸玉琴。\n紫凤翱翔碧霄外，人间何必有知音。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":38213,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"幽石 其二","author":"刘璟","text":"冉冉征途自不閒，云飞鸟倦亦知还。\n何如蓬荜韬光者，放浪形骸宇宙间。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":38214,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄题西湖","author":"刘璟","text":"西湖物色四时春，罗绮香风伴醉人。\n莫向登临重回首，六桥西畔更伤神。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":38215,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"荔枝图","author":"刘璟","text":"海青使臣驰驿传，昼夜能行一千里。\n谁想骊妃欢笑中，黍离悲歌已盈耳。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":38216,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"墨菊 其一","author":"刘璟","text":"柴桑处士多佳致，种得幽花满石坛。\n月转南山秋夜寂，蹁跹玄鹤舞■岏。","collection":"明","notice":"含缺文或待核对标记，按原文保留。","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer"